WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Open Resilience and Verifications to evaluate security and fault tolerance using real telemetry.

00:05.000 --> 00:10.000
FortiX flushes telemetry buffers and compares baseline, fault-injection, and recovery windows.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.000
PASS means observed requests proved every threshold; FAIL means a policy or latency breach occurred.

00:15.000 --> 00:20.000
INCONCLUSIVE prevents vacuous passes when zero or insufficient traffic traversed the route.

00:20.000 --> 00:25.000
Export JSON or PDF verification evidence reports once remediation checks pass deterministically.
